    "chunk_text": "Wutan we gebiddan God ealmihtine, heofena heah cyning, and Sancta Marian, and ealle Godes halgan Wutan we gebiddan for urne papan on Rome, and for urne cyning, and for urne arcebiscop and for urne Wutan we gebiddan for ure godsybbas and for ure cum\u00e6\u00f0ran, and for ure gildan and gildsweostra, and Bidde we. For \u00feorfer\u00fees saule bidde we Pater noster, and for M\u00e6lm\u00e6re saule, and for ealle \u00fea saula \u00fee fulluht.",
